# artifacts / large data.
#
# EXCEPTION: artifacts/ holds the SHIPPED production model and is committed
# deliberately, so the repo can be cloned and served without retraining —
# 5 ensemble checkpoints (~5.7MB) plus the fitted scaler and SHAP background
# (~44KB). Inference needs the exact scaler the model was trained against, so
# the weights alone would not be usable.
#
# Still ignored: artifacts/processed/ (28MB of derived windowed parquet,
# rebuildable from the raw dataset in one command) and every experiment tree
# below (rejected variants; their metadata is committed for provenance, the
# weights are not needed to run anything).
artifacts/processed/
artifacts_mvp_2017/weights/*.pt
artifacts_mvp_2017/scaler/*.joblib
artifacts_mvp_2017/scaler/*.npy
artifacts_mvp_2017/processed/
artifacts_logvar15/weights/*.pt
*.parquet
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
